{"body":{"says":"One session of work with the author: when it ran, what it stood beside, the words it received in order, and the paths of evolution it noted."},"id":"01M6RBNRG0HPKFKVC8BXEVQEX0","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"beside":{"optional":true,"says":"What ran beside it, as the arity of sessions grows: a note in words until that session is a holon to point at.","shape":"string"},"ended":{"optional":true,"says":"How its end was declared, where it was declared: a session is ended by being said to end.","shape":"string"},"forkedAt":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The utterance of that session at which it was forked.","shape":"ref"},"forkedFrom":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"For a session forked from another: the session it was forked from.","shape":"ref"},"notes":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"Holons it wrote that stand on their own and that it points at, such as a licence reading.","shape":{"set":"ref"}},"on":{"says":"The day it ran.","shape":"date"},"paths":{"holds":true,"says":"Paths of evolution the session noted, in the order noted.","shape":{"list":"ref"}},"said":{"holds":true,"says":"The author's utterances, in the order they came.","shape":{"list":"ref"}},"sent":{"holds":true,"optional":true,"says":"The messages it sent to other sessions, where their timelines meet: held as its own.","shape":{"list":"ref"}}},"name":"session","prev":"sha256-29013994306a143b78366d1ad8a04cd3bb71b1dff8b583269c9b4852264a203d"}
{"body":{"says":"A possible evolution of glass, noted before it is weighed: what it opens, what unsettled decisions it rests on, and where it stands."},"id":"01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"from":{"holds":false,"says":"The utterances it was said in.","shape":{"set":"ref"}},"opens":{"says":"What it makes possible.","shape":"string"},"restsOn":{"says":"The decisions not yet settled that it leans on: notes in words until those decisions are holons to point at.","shape":{"list":"string"}},"stands":{"says":"noted, weighed, chosen or let go.","shape":"string"}},"name":"path","prev":"sha256-fc3ea6903f32f1c4e73b9c8c1676a24fa44648f1e2dda5b2fd242f56d6cc0675"}
{"body":{"says":"A statistic over the field, declared as functional data: prose and an expression, drawn whenever looked at, so it is always of the store as it stands and nothing derived goes stale."},"id":"01M6SDCDGQHFA35J0S9X9MY54K","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"drawn":{"says":"How it is best looked at: a number, a table by kind, a matrix, a landscape by height.","shape":"string"},"gives":{"says":"The expression that gives it, evaluated over the store wherever it is drawn; its result is never kept.","shape":"expression"},"says":{"says":"What it measures and why, in prose: the statistic is its prose as much as its expression.","shape":"string"},"status":{"optional":true,"says":"proposed, until the functions it calls are built.","shape":"string"}},"name":"statistic","prev":"sha256-1598269aa7eb104f1550ab274a851654ae2313c5cb43d7aa8aa10881dd42ecae"}
{"body":{"says":"A function, as field/types/function.json declares it, carried here until the field joins the union; the two are one type to be merged by id when it does."},"id":"01M6SDCDGQS54QF64WHWPH75Q5","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"from":{"optional":true,"says":"Where the holon was born from, as a path in the files it arrived from.","shape":"string"},"gives":{"optional":true,"says":"For a function of one's own, the expression it gives, each argument it was given named as { arg: i }.","shape":"expression"},"native":{"optional":true,"says":"For one of glass's own, the name the engine evaluates it by.","shape":"string"},"says":{"optional":true,"says":"What it gathers, in a sentence.","shape":"string"},"takes":{"optional":true,"says":"What it is given, each in turn: a set, any number of sets, words, a store's key, or an axis to group by; nothing unless it says.","shape":{"list":"string"}}},"name":"function","prev":"sha256-8f6c544851bb017db657f525342da2b4069fa47b7c7f201aa18075ce0f02fb14"}
{"body":{"says":"A source read from outside the field: kept by its link and what was found in it, never by a copy of it."},"id":"01M6SMDF182T6XQ6CF6CC2Q2EH","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"found":{"says":"What was found in it, each a figure or a fact as the source gave it, not checked beyond it.","shape":{"list":"string"}},"link":{"says":"Where it was read, as an address on the web: a route, not a reference.","shape":"string"},"read":{"says":"When it was read.","shape":"date"}},"name":"source","prev":"sha256-69d832a4c2e736ddef35327d18ff6c2bcdea78ae35adc868a4e1b518b1753971"}
{"body":{"says":"Who speaks: an author, a session, a fork, a writer read from outside. An utterance says its voice by pointing at one."},"id":"01M6SMRS977B9PNDXB497RY8NS","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"of":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The holon it is the voice of, where there is one: a session, a source.","shape":"ref"}},"name":"voice","prev":"sha256-ed983a587c49a08ae03ae700a91159a42d8c4dc2bd888f2f0f02b7fbbd4cc541"}
{"body":{"says":"A piece of knowledge under the rule, one understanding, each part standing on those before it: its flow, then its sections. A brief mounted in the flow of another is a break, as starting a new file was, and that placing is the deliberate act. Exports to markdown from its depth and order while it nests no more than a heading can."},"id":"01M6SMW4015AT7Y2J8ADVARYVF","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"parts":{"holds":true,"says":"Its sections, the briefs read through after its flow, in order, each with its name as a heading at its depth. Nothing follows them, as nothing can follow a heading and not belong to it.","shape":{"list":"ref"}},"path":{"optional":true,"says":"The file it was unpacked from, for the brief a file is.","shape":"string"},"prose":{"says":"Its flow, in any order: mounts of anything, a paragraph, a list, code, a statistic, a brief. Each reference says for itself whether it holds or points. What stands here is drawn as itself, so a brief shows its face.","shape":{"list":"ref"}}},"name":"brief","prev":"sha256-f5bf1af6f454c23c9c4b60b91d41cbb66d318a52caa490416dd492d3e2716383"}
{"body":{"says":"A matter raised in what was said and not yet owned by what is built: what it asks, where the author left it, the sentences it was raised in, and the briefs it bears on. The author's own words stay its ground, pointed at and never retold as settled; held as a holon because that is the respectful way to hold another's words."},"id":"01M6W3V08EZAS7W5P34D29HC2S","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"asks":{"says":"What it holds open, or what was said that steers, in the session's words.","shape":"string"},"raised":{"holds":false,"says":"The author's sentences it was raised in, as they were said.","shape":{"set":"ref"}},"stands":{"says":"open, leaning, settled or let go: as the author left it, not as a brief made it.","shape":"string"},"touches":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The briefs it bears on, where one says more or less than the author did.","shape":{"set":"ref"}}},"name":"thread","prev":"sha256-6cbab663eeb4a05aad6946419f62100bdbac70e621cf4450e44fcd714727f7bd"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6RBNS1M8AFS7CMVCS632G20"}],"opens":"A page laid in the field is of the field: its state navigable as a loop of a video archive, tracks placed on your own canvas and played, websites joined in a presentation that suits one's expression.","restsOn":["streams, being specced by the first session","ranges","how an integration's entities are created","moulds"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6RBNTR6Z9HBVB1670DMZ417","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"A site of sites","prev":"sha256-47081c8d523b162d14d27b7f6f7d864c74ef30a2986790216ae0c996debf0560"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6RBNS3RPYW7KEFTPE0FPW8G"},{"$ref":"01M6RBNS4SMTQE5KW7E8F5C9PB"},{"$ref":"01M6RBNSDWQENX4QSBH55SNVFV"}],"opens":"A website within glass is not another origin but within the OS, read through the website itself: a native shell owning its webviews, the chassis the seam.","restsOn":["where the sandbox's duty lands, in the engine and the field's declarations"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6RBNTR718C3RC14A6XST1S4","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"Glass as the OS","prev":"sha256-ed41a7869792b9e709165fb97d2abf7c2175c36f6dfa652d19bdf92316adfb42"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6RBNSDWQENX4QSBH55SNVFV"}],"opens":"Tab and OS as grounds of the same primitives, integration between: open-ended, groundable in various aspects, nothing preventing evolution compounding across grounds.","restsOn":["the chassis as the only part that differs"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6RBNTR87H8X6FMXDE6ACSCM","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"Grounds coexisting","prev":"sha256-c14b04ecd6c19e4edd908ab21c6b4236994c35323a7990b7770d2a8daf2e94a3"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6RBNSS3CC38HDAWWKXCTYT4"}],"opens":"Within the browser the local store is bounded and holds transparently owned data, bought music or video, inferred or shared data, holonically operable, with the immediacy of interface.","restsOn":["integrations for media owned"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6RBNTR9CNSQNWE2HYQMHGA9","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"What is owned, held in the bounded store","prev":"sha256-37e8a4169d254350980e95a92910b84e88394cb436655652c2dd290c8ecfdecd"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6RBNSDWQENX4QSBH55SNVFV"},{"$ref":"01M6RBNSS3CC38HDAWWKXCTYT4"}],"opens":"Once glass is birthed enough, existing software is specified by operating it under inference, as the rule was used in a closed-source project, and the mechanics shown under a group of projects.","restsOn":["programs and runs","AI as programs in the field"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6RBNTRAP5XSW89BA2NGJ4ZZ","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"Reverse re-emanation","prev":"sha256-65f8b1b0cd12b2eb8cf2705018e3dbea1eaf212cb405a0700bf547b51913635a"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6RBNSDWQENX4QSBH55SNVFV"},{"$ref":"01M6RBNSS3CC38HDAWWKXCTYT4"}],"opens":"A platform where what is owned or shared passes between fields; its name not social media, and not commons, a word held by governance; shareship said beside ownership.","restsOn":["a name not yet found"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6RBNTRB8Y54ZTPSWYT655ZS","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"Sharing between fields","prev":"sha256-09e1551d2567b76248edeb2de2c1745fc38d31654dc12c1b30fa8729db122360"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6RBNT10CV7S9C6M4A97B0KJ"},{"$ref":"01M6RBNT5FN0JH2X64E5CC7HJR"},{"$ref":"01M6RBNTAVMCBF0HJDEJFTTWSX"},{"$ref":"01M6RBNTGYBQEWPE8FZ68FFB2P"}],"opens":"Expression held as holons down to the word: words near each other in one utterance relate more than the same word elsewhere, the near relation read from what holds them and the far one from their lexeme. This session is its first instance.","restsOn":["the types of prose, drafted, not confirmed","the count of holons, now measured once"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6RBNTRCYKW8FS96J8ZPC9Q7","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"Prose to the word, by locality","prev":"sha256-f5cce405c76bcbb472b1bee8b22624ace7f42d168f2d198e11dafabb37dbbbac"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6RBNT5FN0JH2X64E5CC7HJR"}],"opens":"A branch is a store, and unlike git's, relational: no longer stale, still a branch, seen from the front as a whole rather than from the side as a fork; this series itself a store of its own. A valuable future development of the store.","restsOn":["taking a whole away as a store","how stores relate to the stores they branched from"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6RBNTRD3HHH64VCH3MZ8GMA","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"A branch as a store","prev":"sha256-3dd01cd581e8a0a84b88e29cc2ac010c7b1b68e248a94b960583e54637e560c3"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6RBNT5FN0JH2X64E5CC7HJR"},{"$ref":"01M6RBNT6P5Y6W2XMCC1BDJNDQ"},{"$ref":"01M6RBNTAVMCBF0HJDEJFTTWSX"}],"opens":"Not login but proof: a commit's hash set into a public chain proves a series of events was observed in a particular way from a certain point in time, and no one can mask over it after; only the hash goes public, the store stays its owner's.","restsOn":["signing commits by key","which public chain, and what anchoring costs"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6RBNTRESVBEG4B1W8GFKWNG","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"History anchored in public","prev":"sha256-073770026eeefad9eca2f5cc90593fedd2dc5812f80a4ab603eaee3edea2bb75"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6RBNT5FN0JH2X64E5CC7HJR"},{"$ref":"01M6RBNTAVMCBF0HJDEJFTTWSX"}],"opens":"No backend for auth: public data encrypted to the degree the data itself is built upon, so whoever holds the key reads, and authority is in the keys and not in a server. Asked from curiosity about the nature of authority, not as a direction.","restsOn":["how keys are held and given","what is encrypted, and at which holon"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6RBNTRFE191GKSCF2VYQ4ZK","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"Authority held in keys","prev":"sha256-576661b4b109ac0537c1e366d9842353374d1e957852ae04a1b23a03c6c9cd8d"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6RBNTAVMCBF0HJDEJFTTWSX"},{"$ref":"01M6RBNTGYBQEWPE8FZ68FFB2P"}],"opens":"A piece closed, then observable, then closed and observable again; invisible holons on other holons; and prose at the fidelity one is attuned to, a sentence a string or its words, recursable, a string the closed form and its holons the open one.","restsOn":["whether a string is ever stored or only drawn","what is not yet in a holon: to enter, reachable, or created"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6RBNTRG6RYS3F14VDJKE4GH","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"Pieces opened and closed","prev":"sha256-4fe9ca3d47d4c8be332da3133cd542e6b13bbae32c46469d0fc516e0c39db70b"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6RBNTGYBQEWPE8FZ68FFB2P"}],"opens":"A word's meaning is only its relations within the field; on that, primitive patterns: knowledge graphs upon terms, and other components; terms perhaps not functional without something of more breadth, like symbols. Landscape, levels, holarchies and systems as one family of words.","restsOn":["what a symbol is beside a term","the types of prose, drafted, not confirmed"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6RBNTRHK0RQZ28GTAMZXV9T","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"Ontology in the field","prev":"sha256-020543fbf1f1897b2d8ddabc33b9d1c4d1a41eadf6cbbed889d86875b27bf236"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6RBNTR5YKMTMENXGXJRGKH5"}],"opens":"A larger piece read in whole, then drawn over by isolated readers, each a branch of its own: the top of the gradient over a large quantity of holons, what matters changing with height, a steering made and then forgotten so the branches stand further apart; new ways of digesting branches made from them.","restsOn":["a branch as a store","what a digest of branches is"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6RBNTRJ3FZVFF2J7Q84TJQ9","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"Many branches over one held space","prev":"sha256-b370522d2d1f9bcee68f704ab9ea144b4419e25526a1a4e22f1e3efb1caac54d"}
