0KK4WDR"},{"$ref":"01M6SFVHPGXKMTSW9DC8MPN8G8"},{"$ref":"01M6SFVHQ92NSNQCWTT04A4DBJ"},{"$ref":"01M6SFVHRD0QB1BVXTA2E5Q2SS"},{"$ref":"01M6SGJBD9PXRB1ARPWX9WJCY0"},{"$ref":"01M6SGJBEJG9JSD3KB3JPCHPPX"},{"$ref":"01M6SGJBFGYET93F18WQ7D2J8G"},{"$ref":"01M6SGV1AAZJ093EH6YYCMKA3F"},{"$ref":"01M6SH3TZJJMH2QNC5MKNAYW7X"},{"$ref":"01M6SHFWX7E01Y5ZYR75H9D94Q"},{"$ref":"01M6SHMCY47QREGPZX13PKRBGQ"},{"$ref":"01M6SHVVW3VK7SJFNBKHJGXTMF"},{"$ref":"01M6SJ126Y7ZGXDRN3MECEAPVH"},{"$ref":"01M6SJEN4QRBRCKMSY7RFPMEZP"},{"$ref":"01M6SJHD6VQQMF23RDSX0TGSQ4"},{"$ref":"01M6SJXJVMWE76XBWKJZTHZPKR"},{"$ref":"01M6SJXT8RMBNFPTSEZYEGP48T"},{"$ref":"01M6SJY1YD5C7ZA1CPR8Z149C4"},{"$ref":"01M6SK76Z6KT76QXT5D8WEDFTS"},{"$ref":"01M6SKEYAF0VEK3PFS5KY5GC28"},{"$ref":"01M6SKF5GDF67VR36ZMXSCASKH"}]},"id":"01M6RBNTRKQMYRWQNZ417ESC0P","instance":["01M6RBNRG0HPKFKVC8BXEVQEX0"],"kind":"version","name":"A second session, and glass named an operating system","prev":"sha256-e61b23abe0312a484ef2378e152689ad41469f5c29defdda3745d96278e21c89"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6SCY283VN52G8DJ40Y6VE15"}],"opens":"Every run and saved store read under one union, since holons are holons and the union is always divisible again by them; sessions coordinating around one available state, unintrusive by nature, each adding and none rewriting another's.","restsOn":["a union as a reading of stores, not a store that moves them","the licence boundary as a store boundary"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6SCY284MB98SC2AJ0B1PMX7","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"A union of stores","prev":"sha256-36207c71cff1a05f216ad1a0b7dd890ec925847875c16fcbd15b979b79f40c76"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6SCY283VN52G8DJ40Y6VE15"}],"opens":"Branches drawn across variables, model from the most basic to the highest, seed from inside or outside the held space, with unifying points held fixed across them: the same base, the same brief, the same seed across models.","restsOn":["which models can be reached","a digest that reads a matrix, not a list"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6SCY284QRWND17759GE4JTY","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"A matrix of readers","prev":"sha256-195c1fdd20275c3a589afe47bd4be027a9d5ceb5237a4203718d17adf4e81ffa"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6SDB75ZWPY296A90SEMK12V"}],"opens":"Everything derived over the store is a function of it: statistics declared as functional data, in prose and in expression, drawn by the interface whenever looked at and never kept as results; and a completion model that streams slots, expressions and interfaces natively, not markdown.","restsOn":["functions that count and measure","streams, being specced by the first session","native prose"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6SDB75ZS2Y1K5WGHA9G4PF9","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"Statistics declared, not stored","prev":"sha256-7ae1600443ceb2e8944b7e488ddc92007ec3188a8c5004c6893fc142d55fdf86"}
{"body":{"drawn":"a landscape by height","gives":{"call":"measure","with":[{"call":"type","with":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"}]},"depth"]},"says":"For each branch, what its understandings say matters, gathered by how far below the top they stand: the variable as it changes with ascension and descension.","status":"proposed"},"id":"01M6SDCDGQ54Q4MTPS04C3PS3Y","instance":["01M6SDCDGQHFA35J0S9X9MY54K"],"kind":"version","name":"What matters by height","prev":"sha256-e99d8d85da3c54fe26eda169b353b0aada44d856fc6b6fe14a35bb7a20ddfbb9"}
