{"body":{"drawn":"a table by kind, median and most","gives":{"call":"measure","with":[{"call":"group","with":[{"call":"everything","with":[]},"type"]},"held"]},"says":"For each kind, how many parts its holons hold: where the field branches wide, as a sentence into words, and where it is thin, as a paragraph that is mostly one sentence.","status":"proposed"},"id":"01M6SDCDGQV2TZ5VNSJKMEWHQS","instance":["01M6SDCDGQHFA35J0S9X9MY54K"],"kind":"version","name":"Held arity","prev":"sha256-3ccb3700f156b2ab63b1815059e30fbba1dc831fcb9aebbec553de6612ecdd6f"}
