{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6SMDF1EE7MGWN7XJVXF48GA"},{"$ref":"01M6SMDF1GA5K2MFBBNT9T8N38"},{"$ref":"01M6SMDF1GD007N78NSWY9HFCY"}],"opens":"What can be downloaded by appropriate means and brought in as pure mechanics enters one's own field; rights return only when it is shared onward. Rendering from the source at read time needs no copy, caching is ordinary, and only a copy that stands in for a work needs its author.","restsOn":["licences read as holons, as the paper's was"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6SMDF1GF8TKW0EWS5KH74EC","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"A line of hygiene for data","prev":"sha256-b00440783605144db4459e98cba0e1ededca05a7cfe29d45cc049b4ef33584e7"}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"01M6SMDF1FRHEWAQVCRKM06C86"},{"$ref":"01M6SMDF1GEDBT2B8JNCCYJG96"}],"opens":"Feeds and common media brought in as holons down to the word, read across sources by locality and shared words, arranged as compositions and layers, with analysis drawn and never stored.","restsOn":["the window","native prose","statistics declared"],"stands":"noted"},"id":"01M6SMDF1GKRFR6Y1M6YJM2KKX","instance":["01M6RBNRG7D2ZC5P6JEVK0SY5G"],"kind":"version","name":"A browser that reads in holons","prev":"sha256-5cb3b15b485e48dafa7f28bc30433fd62cd1c098e75cf9e750b12a817d8a2713"}
