{"body":{"asks":"A stream is an integration, a temporary store that never outlives a reboot: a commit may point at a buffer that later vanishes, other programs read and write streams live, and a completion model's run is purely its input and its output.","raised":[{"$ref":"01M6SMY092Q7S1AB1F8BB4DTD5"},{"$ref":"01M6SMY0BKGDRH71V16JPC477N"}],"stands":"leaning","touches":[{"$ref":"01M6SMWMMPC5P9NMM8PYQWWQAJ"},{"$ref":"01M6SMWMMQHTNN2D7TQZVBXH0P"}]},"id":"01M6W3V08W1RTW4FV3NR7QT8EG","instance":["01M6W3V08EZAS7W5P34D29HC2S"],"kind":"version","name":"Streams as integrations","prev":"sha256-f631ccb1f30076dba69e9a4ab51dd4e8d3952fc6a14126a2759715a5dd482df0"}
{"body":{"asks":"What depends on something that may vanish depends on it by its declared lifetime: if declared to die, recreating it is no problem, and recreating a missing buffer by itself is not quite pure. The relations set lifetime aside.","raised":[{"$ref":"01M6SMY26YFSK3YCS7682SGBVY"}],"stands":"leaning","touches":[{"$ref":"01M6SMWH6G1VG50SD868R3TNS4"}]},"id":"01M6W3V08Z08MA57PHMD1BD9Y5","instance":["01M6W3V08EZAS7W5P34D29HC2S"],"kind":"version","name":"Lifetime as a contract","prev":"sha256-11ee9bbf1213db7d01efbc901e05572101d9182f2f0eeac131739d4d133743fd"}
{"body":{"asks":"Keeping an act at the fidelity of the act was offered as a possibility, tied to streams, with commits kept at the lowest possible fidelity for now; the briefs took it as settled ground for prose as holons.","raised":[{"$ref":"01M6SMXYHXYH7TNE5610QK96C4"},{"$ref":"01M6SMXZ1PTHE64PYFCEW8872W"}],"stands":"open","touches":[{"$ref":"01M6SMWH6G1VG50SD868R3TNS4"}]},"id":"01M6W3V0933P6P03AT7S8NDKZ5","instance":["01M6W3V08EZAS7W5P34D29HC2S"],"kind":"version","name":"The fidelity of history","prev":"sha256-4434619a3a459c72dd1f5af5bc74a7dd1b7317333c8f1b0cdf195d511474b83b"}
{"body":{"asks":"Is a buffer made by writing the field, the integration answering, or by running a program the integration provides; and how does free typing in the search show change at once while the address stays the truth of where one looks.","raised":[{"$ref":"01M6SMY1R12EBBY8Y7YDYSHG41"},{"$ref":"01M6SMY1XW2X8B2H9YY8N93P1Z"}],"stands":"open","touches":[{"$ref":"01M6SMWD7SCMSH6NPMBB74Q1E8"}]},"id":"01M6W3V0971DQF345WWQWMVVP6","instance":["01M6W3V08EZAS7W5P34D29HC2S"],"kind":"version","name":"How a stream is made, and the search","prev":"sha256-80f75c7f899595701d81aac3cc5b52563b28c591d968eec9459b860131c2e7fd"}
{"body":{"asks":"The author was not ready to think about indexes: agents reasoning originally, joined to reach consensus, then three set to prove it wrong, one aligned with what the world already learned.","raised":[{"$ref":"01M6SMXYSS5VZT6Y5AN2RBRY8P"},{"$ref":"01M6SMXYWF6ZEB99PWRARFA0PY"}],"stands":"open","touches":[{"$ref":"01M6SMWMMQHTNN2D7TQZVBXH0P"}]},"id":"01M6W3V09B0JD4ADB0CA9W6TRE","instance":["01M6W3V08EZAS7W5P34D29HC2S"],"kind":"version","name":"How the index work is done","prev":"sha256-6af927bc8dcdc5b99763b9e489bf64a96ebbea909dc1b08dd664618b1829431b"}
