{"body":{"asks":"Collaboration, peer-to-peer and real time are ground the author has not thought about: a knowledge space virtualized together, its parts owned by different people.","raised":[{"$ref":"01M6SMXN6B6A635S4HR058FF31"}],"stands":"open","touches":[{"$ref":"01M6SMWH6G1VG50SD868R3TNS4"},{"$ref":"01M6SMWMMQHTNN2D7TQZVBXH0P"}]},"id":"01M6W3V09ZWARC9AKS73355ESH","instance":["01M6W3V08EZAS7W5P34D29HC2S"],"kind":"version","name":"Peers, real time and shared knowledge, unthought","prev":"sha256-899569a6619f1bc859b89c57668529025f78f72f909b8de974673417b7083f4f"}
{"body":{"asks":"A single owner makes the author sad to the bones; if both sources are true it does not matter where a part is taken from. The single owner is to stay hard to adopt.","raised":[{"$ref":"01M6SMXQZ87JSGGJKRDN6H3XB5"}],"stands":"leaning","touches":[{"$ref":"01M6SMWH6G1VG50SD868R3TNS4"}]},"id":"01M6W3V0A3EYRG222A2KE6FYFQ","instance":["01M6W3V08EZAS7W5P34D29HC2S"],"kind":"version","name":"Many owners, felt","prev":"sha256-23279eff5bdfb70f9c49ed15c91ca42d98df6b56a26e126504574719c9308330"}
{"body":{"asks":"The author asks for a sparring partner who reasons enough and does not rush to settle, answering again as if its last answer had not been read.","raised":[{"$ref":"01M6SMXN4E4F4T7M224CXYXFSR"}],"stands":"settled","touches":[{"$ref":"01M6SMWNPTGG3P4Q5ZWYSJ9HRS"}]},"id":"01M6W3V0A7E4SA3WENQHNJX8D3","instance":["01M6W3V08EZAS7W5P34D29HC2S"],"kind":"version","name":"A sparring partner, not settling early","prev":"sha256-56d982c4eddccb89456546b151ef168294e6f539180ac6a5247543a8cdc3ed58"}
{"body":{"asks":"An interface is to support the multidimensionality of holons standing in many wholes, rather than choosing one for them.","raised":[{"$ref":"01M6SMXRJ1E00W2X8HNAC7GRWS"}],"stands":"open","touches":[{"$ref":"01M6SMWD7SCMSH6NPMBB74Q1E8"}]},"id":"01M6W3V0AB6P6VBFJYCNM25AP2","instance":["01M6W3V08EZAS7W5P34D29HC2S"],"kind":"version","name":"An interface for many dimensions","prev":"sha256-5d2b6a5a20922c9dc11911f4682fa498976968562d814777552c1dc8dd2142d7"}
{"body":{"asks":"The other way around from selection: components say what they take, consume it from the shared everything, and everything composes by itself; a strange idea, and whether it holds without ownership.","raised":[{"$ref":"01M6SMXH7GX7Y1TW946A8G6RDC"}],"stands":"open","touches":[{"$ref":"01M6SMWD7SCMSH6NPMBB74Q1E8"}]},"id":"01M6W3V0AFDEJHACX8CXQSFSEA","instance":["01M6W3V08EZAS7W5P34D29HC2S"],"kind":"version","name":"Components that consume from everything","prev":"sha256-eb9752b5d7ed2ca642c6986b1bfa659ae9d032c6657c17760792cdf281b2911c"}
{"body":{"asks":"Thinking of stores can be static, but in real life things are processes: a store of the future where any namespace can be a store, in real time and between peers.","raised":[{"$ref":"01M6SMXMNR39VMAGMFW7DQ3VTJ"}],"stands":"open","touches":[{"$ref":"01M6SMWMMQHTNN2D7TQZVBXH0P"}]},"id":"01M6W3V0AJ2G5F1RPXX7TDGPW0","instance":["01M6W3V08EZAS7W5P34D29HC2S"],"kind":"version","name":"The store as a process","prev":"sha256-ae7ba34f95d1e9f895ee7240381400a619006db3f1b00b607f93e0dbcca03a75"}
